    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d52">

                <pb facs="0164" n="72" xml:id="pg72"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/8767</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul General at London</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Skinner</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 5438</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">London</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-01-19">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 19, 1918</hi></date>. <lb/> [<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Received February 5.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to bring to the attention
                    of the Department the enclosed speech of the Prime Minister, Mr. Lloyd George,
                    delivered on January 18 at the Central Hall, Westminster, before 350 delegates
                    representing labor organizations, and assembled for conference with the Minister
                    of National Service, as reported in the <hi rendition="#italic">Morning
                        Post.</hi>
                </p>
                <p>The most interesting feature of this meeting was the questioning of the Prime
                    Minister by various delegates who enquired closely with respect to the “freedom
                    of the seas” and other questions of present importance.</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Robert P. Skinner</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d52-a1.xml" xpointer="d52-a1"/>
            </div>
